        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahh... What a nostalgic feeling!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, was it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, ahaha! I see... So that's what's going on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "I remember now, Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've already gotten what I came for. You can all go now. Shoo.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "You...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "W...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "... What, do you lot want to stay here and die? That's perfectly fine by me. You're all free to do as you please.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're falling back. Let them go. Talulah's orders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget it. Things get boring when they get dragged out too long. I hate being bored, that's all there is to it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, I do look forward to seeing you again, Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "As well as... that person.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What...? !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw"
    },
    {
        "text": "Next time, I will hear the truth from you, {@Nickname}.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bye~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1.1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
