        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "What... Why... is she doing this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion... they've left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "--We've long missed the rendezvous time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Retreat back to Rhodes Island... immediately.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll escort... the Operators in the back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "... All right..",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go, Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
