        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "... What...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We're the only two left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I remember now... That, that freak... Talulah... single-handedly...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "She knocked away our Guards like they were toy bricks...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "That monster cut through our Defenders as if they were butter...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hush... Your wounds are deep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Catastrophe...! She is Catastrophe incarnate... How, how else could she have reduced our squads to ashes in an instant...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though I saw it with my own eyes, I can't... I can't believe it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "The screams... Aagh... Gaaaah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Snap out of it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm so sorry... I, I don't know how...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Calm down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "text": "I gave you some emergency treatment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "... Boss... what happened to your arm...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "At least I still have one I can use.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Boss... You should go. I'm sure you'll be able to break your way out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We only managed to stall her for a few minutes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "text": "Until Dr. {@nickname} and Amiya are safe, I cannot go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
