    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Boss... I also...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The price of your life... was paid with my arm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you can live even a single minute longer, it will be worth it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll be right back. Take care of yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
